ameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The central heroine of the game. Being born to a human princess and a demon lord who now after their assassination wants to continue their legacy. Like them, she aims towards the coexistence of humans and demons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However with her country being embroiled in a devastating war with the humans, she now seeks help from and gladly accepts the conditions of Quilt, the protagonist, while also becoming his fiance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist was previously in charge of her education which resulted in Lucina becoming very fond of him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31441"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族の名門であるグリザーニ家の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いわゆる魔王の格を持つ高位の魔族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先代魔王が人間に討たれた後、配下とその一族を守るために後継者として若くして魔王の座に就いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"責任感が強く、グリザーニの一族が滅びるのを防ぐために、ありとあらゆる手を打つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、王としての重責の影に、時折年相応の顔を覗かせることもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10006","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：グリザーニ魔王軍／魔王"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族の名門であるグリザーニ家の姫。いわゆる魔王の格を持つ高位の魔族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先代魔王が人間に討たれた後、配下とその一族を守るために、後継者として若くして魔王の座に就いた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"責任感が○く、グリザーニの一族が滅びるのを防ぐために、ありとあらゆる手を打つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、王としての重責の影に、時折年相応の顔を覗かせることもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「さぁ、兄様……いえ、キルトっ！　妾に改めて忠誠を誓うのじゃっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188274"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/928d8b4f842741bec01bf7e49780f7d746ecd4b1237ad1eb149ab3106fd3805d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e0/e01487b0336395b3fc208a208dbe31113e65fb57a1946fe4c1df99cb7810e0ad.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"梶田夕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188274:6106:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31442","characterName":"ガーネット・トイクロス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188275","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10007"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31442"},"originalCharacterName":"ガーネット・トイクロス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A harpy who became the general of the Gurizani army after the death of the previous one during the golem war. Childhood friend of Salacia and close aide of Lucina. Usually very mature, only Quilt is able to anger her swiftly given their shared past."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31442"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルキナの最も信頼する配下であり、魔王の近衛も兼ねているグリザーニ家筆頭将軍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇猛な有翼族の槍戦士で、疾風の猛将の異名を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"武術では天性の才覚を持っており、若くして前魔王にも認められ頭角を現し始めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先の人間と魔族の大戦の折、尊敬する前魔王ゼファードを守れなかったことを悔いており、そのたった一人の娘であるルキナに対して、絶対の忠誠を誓っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10007","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：グリザーニ魔王軍／魔族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ルキナの最も信頼する配下であり、魔王の近衛も兼ねているグリザーニ家筆頭将軍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇猛な有翼族の槍戦士で、疾風の猛将の異名を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"武術では天性の才覚を持っており、若くして前魔王にも認められ頭角を現し始めていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先の人間と魔族の大戦の折、尊敬する前魔王・ゼファードを守れなかったことを悔いており、そのたった一人の娘であるルキナに対して、絶対の忠誠を誓っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「姫様は命に代えても、お守りする。……それが私の務めだ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188275"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6e7a61d0b49df053b091148107a258288681e2dfd499d4c8a8b625c4849af9f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c77a7cae294a9bafd57aadd23c634fa706c8ad885bb4755742c3b74f7135c3c3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川瀬ゆう子","creatorId":"vndb:s647","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s647","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s647","name":"川瀬 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188275:16174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31443","characterName":"サラーキア・コーデュロイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188276","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10008"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31443"},"originalCharacterName":"サラーキア・コーデュロイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"近年、グリザーニ魔王軍に所属することとなった魔術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"医術も得意としており、魔王軍お抱えの軍医として“ドクター”という肩書きでも呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は人型の魔族と遜色ない姿だが、その正体は妖艶な美貌と熟れた愛欲に満ちた スキュラ族である。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10008","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：グリザーニ魔王軍／魔族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近年、グリザーニ魔王軍に所属することとなった魔術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔術だけなく医術も得意としており、魔王軍お抱えの軍医として “ドクター” という肩書きでも呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は人型の魔族と遜色ない姿だが、その正体は妖艶な美貌と熟れた愛欲に満ちたスキュラ族である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うふふ、そんなに大きくしちゃって……。気持ち良くなりたいのかしら？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188276"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa9e22035beb1431be6ff8a52b61927dcdca062f857e42aee98cfb75c8b692b7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d1c1a8bd27070075d25df53aaf37e6218803c25e4952c5067b803e33ecaa507a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"竹間千ノ美","creatorId":"vndb:s574","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s574","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s574","name":"緒田 マリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188276:19333:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31444","characterName":"リリシア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188277","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10009"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31444"},"originalCharacterName":"リリシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Originally taken in by Febris, Quilt's mentor, after her death she now serves him faithfully. With her near immortal body and perfect memory she can assist him with various task, which also includes participating in experiments, as subject."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While merely being and wanting to be very affectionate rather than being actually sexually assertive, she is still a massive masochist. Never minding any pain and instead turning such into excitement or straight up pleasure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Albeit using a bow in battle for ranged attacks, she is able to heal other units and also performs the role of a front-line guard."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is, unlike the common beast races, from a rare race called \"Golden Beast\" which albeit their powerful nature have been hunted and discriminated against. When receiving a mortal wound a golden beast will transform into their original shape and lose reason, attacking anyone in sight in order to stay alive."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31444"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公キルトの屋敷で身の回りの世話をしている獣人族の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルトがグリザーニ家に仕えることになったため、彼女も一緒に魔王軍に参加した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生来ドジなところがあり、肝心なところでポカミスをかまし、周囲に迷惑をかけることもしばしばだが、本人の明るくメゲない性格と憎めないタチが幸いして嫌われることは余りない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"希少種の獣人族らしく、異常に治癒力が高く、打たれ強い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10009","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：グリザーニ魔王軍／魔族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・キルトの屋敷で身の回りの世話をしている獣人族の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルトがグリザーニ家に仕えることになったため、彼女も一緒に魔王軍に参加した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生来ドジなところがあり、肝心なところでポカミスをかまし、周囲に迷惑をかけることもしばしばだが、本人の明るくメゲない性格と憎めないタチが幸いして嫌われることはあまりない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"希少種の獣人族らしく、異常に治癒力が高く、打たれ○い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「はワワー!?　痛いッ！　ご主人様の鞭が痛いですワ！　ハッ！　むしろこの痛みこそが……愛ッ!?　私は今とても愛されていますワ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188277"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d1fbc152de164c5171256d2b66a95c2b9940b254ea465d805fc7b40167b474c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/603baa6cef798ecc64fd9d07ee322c857b4ada95b7f7ac5793747fd28528ea33.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"今谷皆美","creatorId":"vndb:s648","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s648","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s648","name":"今谷 皆美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188277:15684:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31445","characterName":"キキョウ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188278","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10019"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31445"},"originalCharacterName":"キキョウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A high-ranking demon merchant who travels all over the demon world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31445"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔界を渡り歩き、武具や魔具を取り扱う魔族の行商団「鉄輪一座（かなわいちざ）」を取りまとめる女商人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"東方の倭国出自の魔族であるらしく、常に和服を着こなしている、艶やかな黒髪の大和撫子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金にはうるさい一方、心許した相手には、尽くすタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"上客ともなれば、色々便宜を図ってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルトが錬金術を学んでいた頃の古い知り合いでもある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10019","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：フリーランス／鬼族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔界を渡り歩き、武具や魔具を取り扱う魔族の行商団 『鉄輪一座（かなわいちざ）』 を取りまとめる女商人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"東方の倭国出自の魔族であるらしく、常に和服を着こなしている、艶やかな黒髪の大和撫子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金にはうるさい一方、心許した相手には尽くすタイプ。上客ともなれば、色々便宜を図ってくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルトが錬金術を学んでいた頃の古い知り合いでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ふふ、地獄の沙汰も金次第とは良く言ったもの……、さて、今日はどんな品物をお求めで？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188278"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd13dae109b21bd9c1b8e2cfd5e5c3ddad9de479a67b51abe573dc68294c9586.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f07d03dbbac1ae64c59f264a37e7c76ea65f6f07f154e4f6aec7ca0de70890e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤本教子","creatorId":"vndb:s649","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s649","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s649","name":"平野響子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188278:5669:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31446","characterName":"セレナ・オペコット","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188279","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10011"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31446"},"originalCharacterName":"セレナ・オペコット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"While growing up in an orphanage, she dedicated herself to the prominent religion of the region which worships the goddess Sharia. She survived a ritual which turned her into a Saint who can turn prayers into powerful light and healing magic."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She and Lucina share the same mother but her father was a sick prince of another country. She was orphaned after the father's death when also her sick mother was sent as supposed sacrifice to the demon lord."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Knowing of her origins but unaware that in fact her mother was never and is still not being held hostage, she enters the labyrinth in order to defeat her sister, for her mother and for peace."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31446"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リルバーナ島の人間の主教であるシャリーア教の高司祭であり、シュミット王国の王族傍系の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"騎竜の戦女神シャリーアの再来と言われる不思議な力を持っており、それゆえにシャリーア教門徒に 強く信奉されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、魔族との戦いのシンボルとして、神殿騎士たちと共に戦の矢面に立つこともある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10011","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：シャリーア教団／人間族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リルバーナ島の人間の主教であるシャリーア教の高司祭であり、シュミット王国の王族傍系の姫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"騎竜の戦女神・シャリーアの再来と言われる不思議な力を持っており、それゆえにシャリーア教門徒に○く信奉されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、魔族との戦いのシンボルとして、神殿騎士たちと共に戦の矢面に立つこともある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「それが私に求められているならば、聖女としての義務を果たすだけです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188279"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/ddd693a43099df986677f67453eee039b151b148aed80e4c1e6a93da1e345a76.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6cb016520e87922d85e03c491272bc2edc2e1865917c1d1f804b32ac62ff70fe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188279:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31447","characterName":"フローレシア・トリアセテート","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188280","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10012"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31447"},"originalCharacterName":"フローレシア・トリアセテート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Triacetate family is from a lineage of heroes which have the blood of dragons flowing within their veins. Here, the young and inexperienced Florensia enters the Labyrinth to fulfill her destiny by slaying the new demon lord, Lucina Velvet Gurizani."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31447"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"リルバーナ島の古い伝承で人間を救った竜の血を引くとされる、勇者の家系の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海運と冒険者の国、サルタニア王国出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間をまとめあげて、魔族と戦う立場のシャリーア教団とも縁が深い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弱きを助け、情に厚く決断力があり、日々の努力を惜しまない努力家。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10012","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：フリーランス／人間族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リルバーナ島の古い伝承で人間を救った竜の血を引くとされる、勇者の家系の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"海運と冒険者の国・サルタニア王国出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間をまとめあげ、魔族と戦う立場のシャリーア教団とも縁が深い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弱きを助け、情に厚く決断力があり、日々の努力を惜しまない努力家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「よ～し、ここはアタシに任せて！　大丈夫！　何とかしてみせるわ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188280"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5aa53d700697d0c2bde3403f65005ec82c4e9837b158d1d2c2c97bf39fe96b68.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3fa70e45980219934434a948ff76370d5f4a60f86e5cba094d7bff02222a4098.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柏木美優","creatorId":"vndb:s1030","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1030","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1030","name":"柏木 美優","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188280:6540:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31448","characterName":"プリマテス・シーチング","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188281","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10013"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31448"},"originalCharacterName":"プリマテス・シーチング","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族の血を引きながら、それを隠し、人間側に協力しているシャリーア教軍の参謀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高位アルケミストでありながら、優秀な軍略家でもあり、何事にも動じない強い精神力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"徹底した怜悧冷徹な采配から、冷血な鉄（くろがね）の軍師と恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、生まれで迫害されたり、一部の心無き人間に犯されるなど、不遇の女軍人とも言える。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10013","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：シャリーア教団／魔族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族の血を引きながらそれを隠し、人間側に協力しているシャリーア教軍の参謀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優秀な軍略家であり、何事にも動じない○い精神力を持ち、怜悧冷徹な鉄の軍師と呼ばれ恐れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、生まれで迫害されたり、一部の心無き人間に○されるなど、不遇の女軍人とも言える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高位のアルケミストでもあり、主人公とも過去に関わりがあるようだが？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「貴君らに与えられた使命は、この区域を死守せよ、です。退くことは許されません」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188281"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/5432c397b8dbe5848af3fb3a1b604b4446dc64c20cb57f6d3350a2fdf9bc4daf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df963e480cbe7611ae77562e2d3fdb21e6e9c332000c525d935a3c674ca3f5d5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"相本 さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s2890","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2890","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2890","name":"相本 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40738","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31449","characterName":"アイオン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188282","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10014"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31449"},"originalCharacterName":"アイオン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A golem who survived the last attack on Gurizani thanks to her master Primates salvaging parts to repair her, making her also very similar to humans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Golems, which all look similar to Aion, are known to be as strong as a company each, making them very valuable assets on the battlefield and they were mainly responsible for killing veterans and nobles that were courageous enough to fight instead of fleeing deeper into the demon world."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The fuel the humans utilize to operate them are the hearts of captured, raped and finally killed demons."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31449"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"先の魔族と人間の大戦で、その大局を決定付けたゴーレム兵の生き残り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近年、劇的に向上しているシャリーア教団のアーティファクト製造技術で作られた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生きた魔導兵器と言われており、圧倒的な火力と装甲によって多数の魔族を葬った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"単身で一つの軍隊に相当する働きをするとされている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10014","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：シャリーア教団／機人族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"先の魔族と人間の大戦で、その大局を決定付けたゴーレム兵の生き残り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近年、劇的に向上しているシャリーア教団のアーティファクト製造技術で造られた生きた魔道兵器と言われており、圧倒的な火力と装甲によって数多の魔族を葬った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"単身で1つの軍隊に相当する働きをするとされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……標的確認。対象を速やかに破壊する」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188282"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d19f1ef076be6573a3e65c6da891ade97f4a9a4dbe2df295a167fc1ff947b0f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae14b68b6da3252e17619cd93faa27ae31133464df932a4760d18070ff6dc824.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂田有希","creatorId":"vndb:s1595","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1595","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1595","name":"坂田 有希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188282:15687:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31450","characterName":"アンナローゼ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188283","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10016"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31450"},"originalCharacterName":"アンナローゼ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious figure who controls the war between the humans and demons."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is Febris, Primates and Quilt's mentor, who was believed to be dead but was actually corrupted by the book of the wisdom she was looking for. The book turned out to be the head of the goddess Sharia who seeks vengeance after being betrayed by the humans she once saved from the demons."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"With Sharia exploiting her contained jealousy towards the human princess who her once beloved fell in love with, she kills both of them and is now after Lucina."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31450"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"近年、リルバーナ島の4王家などに接触するようになった、黒衣を纏った謎の貴婦人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"蟲惑的な雰囲気と魅力的な提案で、話を聞く者を魅きつけてやまず、彼女からの助力を受けた者は、例外なく自らの地位を向上させ、成功へと導かれているのだが……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10016","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：フリーランス／？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近年、リルバーナ島の4王家などに接触するようになった、黒衣を纏った謎の貴婦人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魅惑的な雰囲気と魅力的な提案で話を聞く者を惹きつけてやまず、彼女からの助力を受けた者は例外なく自らの地位を向上させ、成功へと導かれているのだが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「さぁ、私が力を貸してあげましょう。あなたの望むままに……」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188283"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a7317080bb9c095e45724289fedb45684ff3ec424f68e93a66eb8a159def0b6b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/658c121b35cc666a690f5379ca1e9d59a45fc9b53b5d53f584fc653e8ecf4d65.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石松千恵美","creatorId":"vndb:s1164","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1164","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1164","name":"石松 千恵美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188283:4273:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"梅 椿鬼","creatorId":"vndb:s5929","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5929","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5929","name":"梅 椿鬼","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40741","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c31451","characterName":"シャナン・フランネル＝ロードリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188284","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"30048"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10017"],"vndbCharacterId":"c31451"},"originalCharacterName":"シャナン・フランネル＝ロードリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sole daughter of the hell king Agilis Flannel Rodoria and a water dragon. She is send to Gurizani as goodwill ambassador but clashes with Lucina and wants to recruit Quilt for her country, even offering to become his fiance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shanan and Lucina often fight over their breast size and who's better endowed."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31451"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜王アギリスの娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古くから魔界にて対立するグリザーニ家とロードリア家という関係から、ことあるごとにルキナをライバル視している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現時点では、ルキナよりも年上ということもあり、個人戦力、自軍の強大さ、富、胸の大きさ（微妙に）、などなど、ほとんどの項目で勝っているが、唯一婚約者がいないという点において、負けていると悔しがっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10017","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"所属：ロードリア竜王軍／竜族"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"竜王アギリスの娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古くから魔界にて対立するグリザーニ家とロードリア家という関係から、ことあるごとにルキナをライバル視している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現時点ではルキナよりも年上ということもあり、個人戦力、自軍の巨大さ、富、胸の大きさ （微妙に） などなど、ほとんどの項目で勝っているが、唯一婚約者がいないという点において負けていると悔しがっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私が、全てにおいて勝っているのよ。ですからルキナ、大人しくそこの錬金術師を引き渡しなさい！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188284"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0ebf503552f0ba47e2e059f74e87dab565154e5da05585a98651cc580e7d9e8b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36c586cc3da4818c08e799c3e1a3ea27e40d16949999b2e8d90429d0dd9886c2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高村優里","creatorId":"vndb:s354","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s354","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s354","name":"高村 優里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:30048:188284:13512:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c42789","characterName":"アギリス・フランネル＝ロードリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["10018"],"vndbCharacterId":"c42789"},"originalCharacterName":"アギリス・フランネル＝ロードリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hell king of Rodoria, a pure fire dragon and father of Shanan. While respecting the previous demon lord of Gurizani and their non-aggression treaty, he is conquering the rest of the demon world and mercilessly killing anyone who oppose him with his incredible power. An absolute ruler."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42789"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"グリザーニ一族と長年にらみ合い・暗闘を続けてきたロードリア家当主の魔王。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼も魔王ではあるが、グリザーニ家と区別するために「竜王」や俗称の「地獄王」と呼ばれることの方が多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"グリザーニに伝わるアーティファクトと財産を全て我が物にしたうえで、地上の完全制覇すらも目論む徹底した野心家。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10018","sourceWorkId":"15535","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b430ef0e5cb71cabd6e3e4e1fecb5dc23431c853bc4e6e14ebb3bc1810d95a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2637aedba297d49ff1531c9bac91f6f5f44c492f3ae37437b0d255aed2f90ab.webp","width":213,"heigh